---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
css_file: index.css
nav_icon: home
nav_title: Rubber Duck
---

<!-- Masthead / Duck Logo -->
<div class="masthead">
    <a href="/" class="duck-logo-link">
        <img src="/assets/images/rubber-duck-logo.svg" alt="Rubber Duck" class="duck-logo"/>
    </a>
    <div class="tagline">PUSHED TO MAIN</div>
</div>

<!-- Subject Line / Hook -->
<div class="homepage-subject">
    <span class="subject-label">LATEST:</span>
    <span class="subject-text">merge_conflict, NEED REVIEW</span>
</div>

<!-- Headline / Top Story -->
<div class="homepage-headline">
    <h1><span class="gradient-text">Welcome to Rubber Duck</span></h1>
    <p class="headline-hook">Your weekly dose of code, coffee, and chaos</p>
</div>

<!-- Intro / Pathos Section -->
<article class="homepage-intro">
    <div class="intro-content">
        <h2>WHAT IS THIS?</h2>
        <p>
            This newsletter covers my experience as a programmer, student, researcher, and entrepreneur.
        </p>
        <p>
            Get weekly updates on where my projects are going and join a growing, tight-knit community of nerds on the rise.
        </p>
        <p>
            I'll cover everything from how I got started and how I keep my train running. Follow along and try to keep up!
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Featured Image -->
    <div class="featured-image-wrapper">
        <img src="/assets/images/header.jpg" alt="Featured" class="featured-image"/>
    </div>
</article>

<!-- Latest Newsletter Issues -->
<section class="newsletter-archive">
    <h2>RECENT ISSUES</h2>
    <div class="issues-grid">
        {%- for post in collections.newsletter | limit(3) -%}
        <article class="issue-card">
            <div class="issue-number">Issue #{{ loop.index }}</div>
            <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
            <p class="issue-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</p>
            <p class="issue-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </article>
        {%- endfor -%}
        
        <!-- Placeholder if no posts exist -->
        {%- if collections.newsletter.length == 0 -%}
        <article class="issue-card">
            <div class="issue-number">Issue #1</div>
            <h3><a href="/posts/issue-01/">First Post Coming Soon</a></h3>
            <p class="issue-date">October 14, 2025</p>
            <p class="issue-excerpt">The inaugural edition of Rubber Duck is on its way. Stay tuned for developer stories, project updates, and practical insights.</p>
            <a href="/posts/issue-01/" class="read-more">Read More →</a>
        </article>
        {%- endif -%}
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<section class="homepage-cta">
    <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h2>
        <p>Subscribe to get weekly updates delivered straight to your inbox. No spam, just code and caffeine.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <a href="#subscribe" class="btn btn-primary">
                <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Subscribe
            </a>
            <a href="#discord" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <i class="fab fa-discord"></i> Join Discord
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section> 